#ASSERT `the fee payable in` vM `for the service` sPractical `on the day` (YMD 2026 12 31) `, under` (taken (`the readings without one published in November 2026`)) EQUALS JUST 196

§§ `The text as made: the second update day, 1 January 2027, rounding at every update (taken)`

