#ASSERT `the fee payable in` vM `for the service` sLicence `on the day` (YMD 2027 1 1) `, under` (taken (`the illustrative readings`)) EQUALS JUST 292
#ASSERT `the fee payable in` vM `for the service` sTemporary `on the day` (YMD 2027 1 1) `, under` (taken (`the illustrative readings`)) EQUALS JUST 408
#ASSERT `the fee payable in` vM `for the service` sObjPractical `on the day` (YMD 2027 1 1) `, under` (taken (`the illustrative readings`)) EQUALS JUST 42

